---
source: crates/holst-cli/src/table.rs
expression: help_of(line)
---
Log in, log out and check the saved login.

USAGE
  holst auth <command> [flags]

COMMANDS
  login:       Log in and save the login
  logout:      End the server session and forget the saved login
  status:      Show the saved login, account and workspaces

EXAMPLES
  $ holst auth login --email you@example.com
  $ holst auth status
  $ holst auth logout --local-only
